0_define:1_divert:;;divert;nr01 ;0
1_divert:-1
This is a set macros to extract code or text depending on a macro name,
which is defined on the command line.

The macro to use in a text is:
IF: name1; name2; name3; name4; name5 /
HEADIF: heading; name1; name2; name3; name4; name5
TEXT
bla bla
END
CODE
something
END

